    <string name="protected_title">Change a system app?</string>
    <string name="protected_body">This is a system app. A new name or icon is applied everywhere on the device and can make the system confusing or hard to use. You can undo it here at any time; if something breaks, use the recovery steps from the README.</string>
    <string name="protected_dont_show">Don\'t show this again</string>
    <string name="protected_ok">Continue</string>
    <string name="protected_cancel">Cancel</string>
    <string name="self_title">Change HFW\'s own name or icon?</string>
    <string name="self_body">The new name and icon appear on the home screen and everywhere else in the system. Inside HFW the real name always stays, and your data is not affected. If you lose track of it, open it from LSPosed, Modules, HFW, or reset it here.</string>
    <string name="selfhide_title">Hide HFW from the launcher?</string>
    <string name="selfhide_body">It will disappear from the home screen and app drawer. You can still open it from LSPosed, Modules, HFW.</string>
    <string name="show_system_apps">Show system apps</string>
    <string name="show_system_apps_sub">Off by default</string>
    <string name="sys_warn_title">Show system apps?</string>
    <string name="sys_warn_body">System apps are core parts of Android. Changing their name or icon, or hiding them, can make the system confusing or hard to use. Only continue if you know what you are doing. You will not be asked again after you continue.</string>
